{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raiders Rise is an explosive Full-Coop PvPvE Bullet Heaven Rogue-lite where cooperation is essential and competition is inevitable. Team up, withstand relentless waves of monsters, and race to secure valuable resources before anyone else. Surviving together is your only option, but only one team will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover FULL Coop: with allies, and enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy\u2019s richest crystal veins lie in the deadliest places. Crews must work together to overcome traps, storms, and hostile wildlife, but rival raiders are never far behind. Will you form uneasy truces, or sabotage your enemies to steal their haul? Greed makes allies fragile.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crew of Unique Raiders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your raider from a diverse roster of specialists, each with their own tools, abilities, and combat style. Engineers handle the heavy lifting, tanks hold the line, and damage dealers unleash chaos on enemy raiders. Every role matters, and every raider brings a new way to play.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends, Compete for Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced multiplayer matches with your friends. Competitive, but lighthearted, perfect for laughing, experimenting, and enjoying the ride together while pulling off wild stunts and cause just enough chaos to keep things interesting. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Galaxy with Endless Raids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season introduces new raiders, planets, hazards, and gear to expand your adventures. Push deeper, discover stranger worlds, and uncover rare artefacts that change the way you play. The galaxy is vast, dangerous, and always evolving. Only the boldest raiders will rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our community lives on Discord, where you can share feedback, report bugs, or just hang out with fellow raiders. Early adopters might even score exclusive goodies, designed with your input, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to raid? Buckle up for a journey full of strategy, chaos, and galactic shenanigans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376580?t=1773845833","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/adb11c6f4c3584854e9ee345d8aed2b26fecd694/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773845833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/f03906ad43724e51737f29acf5281f5aded117d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773845833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/f03906ad43724e51737f29acf5281f5aded117d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773845833","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raiders Rise is an explosive Full-Coop PvPvE Bullet Heaven Rogue-lite where cooperation is essential and competition is inevitable. Team up, withstand relentless waves of monsters, and race to secure valuable resources before anyone else. Surviving together is your only option, but only one team will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/9aeaacddb923e56d310417e51ccd97c1.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover FULL Coop: with allies, and enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy\u2019s richest crystal veins lie in the deadliest places. Crews must work together to overcome traps, storms, and hostile wildlife, but rival raiders are never far behind. Will you form uneasy truces, or sabotage your enemies to steal their haul? Greed makes allies fragile.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/d7063b3921a89155320fa7f9a1b5f55f.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crew of Unique Raiders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your raider from a diverse roster of specialists, each with their own tools, abilities, and combat style. Engineers handle the heavy lifting, tanks hold the line, and damage dealers unleash chaos on enemy raiders. Every role matters, and every raider brings a new way to play.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/085629191ca2e1a61b51bee618abe8b2.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends, Compete for Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced multiplayer matches with your friends. Competitive, but lighthearted, perfect for laughing, experimenting, and enjoying the ride together while pulling off wild stunts and cause just enough chaos to keep things interesting. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/bc8f5c5798dd825901c842e411930072.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Galaxy with Endless Raids</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season introduces new raiders, planets, hazards, and gear to expand your adventures. Push deeper, discover stranger worlds, and uncover rare artefacts that change the way you play. The galaxy is vast, dangerous, and always evolving. Only the boldest raiders will rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.poster.avif?t=1773845833\" width=540 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.webm?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/extras/7027cfb4238a1c160cad0bde4b6b4881.mp4?t=1773845833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our community lives on Discord, where you can share feedback, report bugs, or just hang out with fellow raiders. Early adopters might even score exclusive goodies, designed with your input, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to raid? Buckle up for a journey full of strategy, chaos, and galactic shenanigans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Penguin Armada"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376580/7ad832a28a606b1759f0dad42eca437ad6004748/header.jpg?t=1773845833","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Raiders Rise and the Raiders Rise logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Penguin Armada S.L. in Europe and/or other countries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00a92024 Penguin Armada and Penguin Armada logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Penguin Armada S.L. in Europe and/or other countries.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3376580/2121206865/6e1f4ebb154d02b15fd9177982e32096e7a74800/1773166050/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773216108","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3376580/2121206865/6e1f4ebb154d02b15fd9177982e32096e7a74800/1773166050/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773216108","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3376580/2121206865/6e1f4ebb154d02b15fd9177982e32096e7a74800/1773166050/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773216108","id":257298992,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298992/6877dd0981b5e9a12f3ab5c1838d981c284685ec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773216108"}],"name":"Raiders Rise","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> A quad-core Intel i5 4th gen or AMD FX equivalent<br></li><li><s